    "name": "SWAT Commander: Prologue",
    "steam_appid": 2428730,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SWAT Commander: Prologue</strong></i><strong> is the FREE introductory version of our upcoming team tactical shooter and does not reflect the final version of the game. Check out our full game's page for a description of its features!</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the prologue, you face the challenges of our second mission \u2013 Hot Reception. <strong>Team up</strong> with your friends in a SWAT squad or go in <strong>solo</strong> to investigate an auto shop where a violent shootout between rival gangs took place. Secure any evidence of criminal activity, bring the perpetrators to justice, and restore order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/5f7b7edb74843a78e4460d8ee9983243.webp?t=1754055054\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/9e90b287f34eca31c3a25a1d49f4bab5.poster.avif?t=1754055054\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/9e90b287f34eca31c3a25a1d49f4bab5.webm?t=1754055054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/9e90b287f34eca31c3a25a1d49f4bab5.mp4?t=1754055054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make yourself familiar with the <strong>mission's briefing</strong> and find out what dangers emerged to threaten innocent civilians \u2013 you're about to face them yourself. Equip your SWAT operative accordingly with a selection of rifles, handguns, armors, and tactical gear to tackle the belligerent gangs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/88329a05ccfe0a9431432d2f56dc4cf7.webp?t=1754055054\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/0cf8fe369ca505452624caea534488f0.poster.avif?t=1754055054\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/0cf8fe369ca505452624caea534488f0.webm?t=1754055054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/0cf8fe369ca505452624caea534488f0.mp4?t=1754055054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a multiplayer lobby to <strong>invite other players</strong> or <strong>go into the mission solo or</strong>\u00a0<strong>join the lobby of another SWAT commander</strong>. Coordinate and discuss your mission plan down to the equipment each of you will be bringing or the entry point you'll be choosing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/f87d3b4a1defdd60dfc2d83bace7e60c.webp?t=1754055054\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/24faa91508283749db123507740987bf.poster.avif?t=1754055054\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/24faa91508283749db123507740987bf.webm?t=1754055054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/24faa91508283749db123507740987bf.mp4?t=1754055054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select one of the <strong>three available game modes</strong> to determine the type of mission you'll be embarking on \u2013 <strong>high-risk warrant</strong>, <strong>barricaded suspect</strong>, and <strong>bomb threat</strong>. Your operations' goals can change between bringing down dangerous suspects, neutralizing entrenched criminals, and defusing an explosive device. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/3af633f93d7a9988ed1be582192fa3de.webp?t=1754055054\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/03969f21c5654e19858c3838376ddc88.poster.avif?t=1754055054\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/03969f21c5654e19858c3838376ddc88.webm?t=1754055054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/03969f21c5654e19858c3838376ddc88.mp4?t=1754055054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>Bernard Tire &amp; Auto Center</strong> to begin the SWAT intervention. Secure your mission objectives and earn an evaluation of your performance. Remember to keep your eyes open and use every tactical advantage you can think of. Defend the innocents and bring the perps to justice!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SWAT Commander: Prologue</strong></i><strong> is the FREE introductory version of our upcoming team tactical shooter and does not reflect the final version of the game. Check out our full game's page for a description of its features!</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the prologue, you face the challenges of our second mission \u2013 Hot Reception. <strong>Team up</strong> with your friends in a SWAT squad or go in <strong>solo</strong> to investigate an auto shop where a violent shootout between rival gangs took place. Secure any evidence of criminal activity, bring the perpetrators to justice, and restore order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/5f7b7edb74843a78e4460d8ee9983243.webp?t=1754055054\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/9e90b287f34eca31c3a25a1d49f4bab5.poster.avif?t=1754055054\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/9e90b287f34eca31c3a25a1d49f4bab5.webm?t=1754055054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/9e90b287f34eca31c3a25a1d49f4bab5.mp4?t=1754055054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make yourself familiar with the <strong>mission's briefing</strong> and find out what dangers emerged to threaten innocent civilians \u2013 you're about to face them yourself. Equip your SWAT operative accordingly with a selection of rifles, handguns, armors, and tactical gear to tackle the belligerent gangs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_i