b_paragraph\" >Select one of the <strong>three available game modes</strong> to determine the type of mission you'll be embarking on \u2013 <strong>high-risk warrant</strong>, <strong>barricaded suspect</strong>, and <strong>bomb threat</strong>. Your operations' goals can change between bringing down dangerous suspects, neutralizing entrenched criminals, and defusing an explosive device. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/3af633f93d7a9988ed1be582192fa3de.webp?t=1754055054\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/03969f21c5654e19858c3838376ddc88.poster.avif?t=1754055054\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/03969f21c5654e19858c3838376ddc88.webm?t=1754055054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/03969f21c5654e19858c3838376ddc88.mp4?t=1754055054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>Bernard Tire &amp; Auto Center</strong> to begin the SWAT intervention. Secure your mission objectives and earn an evaluation of your performance. Remember to keep your eyes open and use every tactical advantage you can think of. Defend the innocents and bring the perps to justice!</p>",
    "short_description": "The FREE CO-OP PROLOGUE version of our tactical squad shooter. In SWAT Commander: Prologue, you join an elite special forces unit. Team up with other operatives, manage your equipment, and most importantly \u2013 complete your mission successfully.",
